==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|ǵʰer}}
Compound of ''co-'' (see ''[[cum]]'') and ''-hors'' (see ''[[hortis]]'')

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|cohors}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|new=1|cohors|cohortis|f|third}}

# a [[court]]
# a [[farmyard]] or [[enclosure]]
# a [[retinue]]
# a [[circle]] or [[crowd]]
# a [[cohort]]; [[tenth]] part of a [[legion]]
# a [[band]] or [[armed]] [[force]]
# a [[ship]]'s [[crew]]
# a [[bodyguard]]
# a [[military]] unit of 500 men

